# One line ending in the repo, whatever the checkout OS: the embedded
# Worker source is compared byte for byte, and scripts must run on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.fig binary
*.p8 binary
